      "statement": "`rusty-cli export <file.zip>` writes the whole store into one zip: `manifest.json`, the database as a `VACUUM INTO` snapshot (consistent while a server writes) made in a folder only the owner can enter and removed afterwards, the brain vault and the skills store with `.git`, empty folders and file modes, and the notes folder only when it lies outside the vault; the zip is written as `<dest>.partial` with mode 0600 and renamed into place when complete.",
